      "hash64": "B233D1EF13F66DB2",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_10",
      "hash64": "19EFDB4A1E0FDB7A",
      "text": "Si j’ai vu juste, it’s okay ! Il peut rester silencieux\\ns’il se sent mieux ainsi.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_11",
      "hash64": "19EFDC4A1E0FDD2D",
      "text": "Attendons simplement qu’il soit à nouveau\\nen mesure de parler. Après tout, ne dit-on pas\\r\\nque tout vient à point à qui sait attendre ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_12",
      "hash64": "19EFD94A1E0FD814",
      "text": "Tout cela m’a montré que connaître plusieurs\\nlangues n’aide pas forcément à comprendre\\r\\nles sentiments des autres.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_13",
      "hash64": "19EFDA4A1E0FD9C7",
      "text": "Mais je ne m’inquiète pas. Je sais que nous nous\\ncomprendrons un jour. Et j’attendrai ce moment\\r\\naussi longtemps qu’il le faudra ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
